{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32663","headline":"月夜闻鹤唳 · 刘沧","name":"月夜闻鹤唳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧落风微月正明，霜毛似怨有离情。\n莓苔石冷想孤立，杨柳叶疎闻转清。\n空夜露残惊堕羽，辽天秋晚忆归程。\n凤凰楼阁知犹恋，终逐烟霞上玉京。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32663.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32663","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}